    },
    {
      "id": "08la033",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "<ul><li>Only gravitational force acts</li><li>Air resistance is neglected</li></ul>",
        "Only gravitational force acts",
        "Air resistance is neglected"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9p3ln2k",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Acceleration Due to Gravity (g)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The acceleration produced in a body due to gravitational pull of Earth is called acceleration due to gravity.",
      "id": "ffmp0g2"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "Symbol: g",
      "id": "maulhpl"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Value on Earth = 9.8 m/s² It is constant for all objects.",
      "id": "iuefq9p"
    },
